OL,3,GNEWSAFlood warnings and water shortages
OL,4,Aafter storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flood warning has been issues for
OL,7,Fparts of West Sussex, while residents
OL,8,Fin Kent are without water, following
OL,9,FStorm Boelo.
OL,11,FHigh tides and strong winds are
OL,12,Fexpected to cause flooding in the
OL,13,Fcoastal areas of Bosham and West
OL,14,FItchenor, including Chidham,
OL,15,FBroadbridge, and Bosham Hoe at around
OL,16,F11:00 GMT on Monday.
OL,18,FAccording to the government's website,
OL,19,Fit will affect Shore Road, Bosham High
OL,20,FStreet and Gloucester Terrace, with
OL,21,Fresidents urged to "activate any flood
OL,22,Fprotection products they may have".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
